{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 36, :comments ["<b>בטחות</b> — Most of the commentators say: they are the kidneys. But the correct view in my eyes: they are the inward parts, like the sense of <b>אמת חפצת בטחות</b>. And the end of the verse indicates it, for it says <b>ובסתום חכמה תודיעני</b>; for the matter is doubled, as is the custom." "<b>שכוי</b> — It is the heart, like <b>עברו משכיות לבב</b>. And the matter is engraved forms, like <b>ואבן משכית</b>. And the forms are the thoughts. And those who understand the sod of the spirit will agree to this."], :book :job, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 38, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Job -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/eyov/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:05:08.443885636Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}